910150/extras/2560b37d30dc7c61f9472c45202b4778.avif?t=1758204542\" width=616 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new ways to approach the game! Take on one of many roles with vastly different playstyles and embark on not-so-epic quests to score some sweet bonus points! Are you going to climb the corporate ladder as the covetous CEO, or scrounge up valuable (and not-so-valuable) treasures as the scavenger?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/737258b8d6d36b07dc46891a7b164ba9.avif?t=1758204542\" width=616 height=146 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A brand-new engine allows for all sorts of new possibilities, including improved visuals, more fluid gameplay and a slew of other modern features. This cutting-edge technology will leave your eyeballs bulging from the excitement overflowing from your brain!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just take a look the animations on the pawn shop!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/0beb42a6c7436e9c5109d6083af31f1f.avif?t=1758204542\" width=616 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay tuned, change the batteries in your smoke detector, and lower your expectations, because Walk of Life is coming, whether you like it or not! Did you want fries with that?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a3d01a6f843f72e0b3ad3.poster.avif?t=1758204542\" width=616 height=616 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910150/extras/2abafa7bc99a